    "identifier": "MTG-73",
    "title": "Separate ContentPack and measure clone costs",
    "description": "Implement the smallest behavior-preserving vertical slice that separates immutable card definitions from mutable match facts. Introduce stable CardDefId values and a shared versioned ContentPack where the current architecture permits, preserve the Python and fixed-action ABIs, and add deterministic seeded-trace coverage. Capture before/after step throughput, MatchState clone cost, representative rollout throughput, allocations or peak RSS, and object-size evidence. Do not introduce page-COW, a broad rules rewrite, deckbuilding, or generic catalog infrastructure. Follow AGENTS.md: all Python commands through uv; rebuild the PyO3 extension after Rust changes. Use docs/research/semantic-kernel.md and wave/rules/README.md as design context.",
